<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26423" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lēvĭtas</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laev-</span></b> ),
			ātis, f.
		2. lēvis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>smoothness</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">speculorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Univ. 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. de Or. 3, 25, 99</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Univ. 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 3, 3, § 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intestinorum,</span>”
				<i>slipperiness, lubricity</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					4, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2,
			8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of speech, <i>smoothness, fluency, facility</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Demosthenes nihil levitate Aeschini et
					splendore verborum cedit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Or. 31, 110</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verborum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 1, 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">effeminata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					3, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
